<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θειόω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεειόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖον</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fumigate with brimstone</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφρα θεειώσω μέγαρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.482
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θειώσας τὰς ἀλλοτρίας
			ἐπινοίας</span>, metaph., from the clothes-cleaner, who used
			sulphur, <i><span class="en">
				Lysipp.
				4
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δω-μα θεειοῦται</span> he
				<i>fumigates his</i> house, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>purify, hallow</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θείου . . θεσμὸν
				αἰθέρος μυχῶν</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				866
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>smear with sulphur</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.658
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔριον τεθειωμένον</span>
			<i>sulphurated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				3.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Alchemy,
				<i>sulphurate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Democr.
			</span></i> ap. Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.153B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖος</span> A) <i>hallow, consecrate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				771b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.374
			</span></i>.</div>
